WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.250
The servers are installed.

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:10.150
After power-up, the team checks that the GPUs show up.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.000
The team prepares networking, software, and cooling for the test.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:21.250
A test job is split across several servers.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.150
The network brings back the results so they can be combined.

00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:32.000
The team compares the result with the agreed criteria.
